  "Name": "REVERSE_WORKORDER_CONSUMPTION",
  "Description": "REVERSE_WORKORDER_CONSUMPTION\n\nThis process allows to partially reverse a consumed qty. The process requires a workorder number, and then the tracking entity that was consumed and the quantity to reverse. The tracking entity will have its qty increased and the consumed qty on the workorder will be reduced.\n\nThis is adjustment process and does not change the original consume transaction is any way.",
